      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "Map<Integer, String> a = new HashMap<>(Map.of(1, \"One\", 2, \"Two\"));\r\nMap<Integer, String> b = new TreeMap<>(Map.of(2, \"Two\", 1, \"One\"));\r\n\r\n//this is to compare two maps\r\n// Method: equals(otherMap)\r\n// What:   returns true if both maps have the same key → value pairs; order and map type do not matter\r\n// Use:    to check if two maps hold the same data\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Are they equal? \" + a.equals(b));\r\nb.put(2, \"TWO\");\r\nSystem.out.println(\"After changing b: \" + a.equals(b));",
